tweets.text:
Introducing the teams that helped bring agent markets to Robinhood Chain and kept building.

@ProjectVEXai runs autonomous trading missions from start to finish. A hard-coded risk layer keeps every action within the user’s rules, even when the agent is operating unattended.

@Wall3_RL puts an institutional macro research desk behind a single AI agent, combining live quantitative signals with specialist analyst agents, onchain and available on demand.

@axol_io made the first official agent debut on Robinhood Chain. Raxol equips agents with dedicated wallets governed by human-signed mandates, while private execution keeps their strategies out of the public mempool.

@KarmaWallet connects trading with everyday finance through wallets, swaps, cards, and real IBANs. Its social layer also rewards strong market ideas when other users act on them.

@tradeongtr brings crypto, perpetuals, stocks, and onchain assets into one trading terminal, giving users a single place to discover and execute opportunities across markets.

@grid_arena turns live stock movements into an onchain prediction arena. Players call what happens next, with results settled transparently in real time.

@bleeep_xyz makes its trading history auditable by committing every decision onchain before the result is known, including the opportunities it chooses to pass on.

Still building. Still shipping.

